{"id": 111, "name": "Edith", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/4/47/Hero1111-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021143348", "cls": ["Tank", "Marksman"], "specialty": ["Control", "Burst"], "difficulty": "30", "stats": ["70", "30", "100", "30"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", "Roam"], "story": "Forsaken Warden with sealed memories.", "skills": [{"name": "Overload", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2fea4f679f7fd59d6ee9062960fe8cb8.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "After each skill cast, Edith and Phylax become Overloaded for 3s, during which all Basic Attacks will trigger chain lightning, dealing extra <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> equal to <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+20% Total Magic Power)</span> plus 3(+0.2*Hero Level)% of the target's Max HP to up to 4 enemies.\nChain lightning damage against Minions is increased to 150%."}, {"name": "Earth Shatter", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_87a69f221b26b4ce2d0443e876ea8eba.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8.5", "desc": "After a 0.75s delay, Edith controls Phylax to launch an earth-shattering blow in a designated direction, dealing 225<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+10% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit (deals 120% damage to minions) and knocking them airborne for 0.8s.\nThis skill can only be interrupted by Suppression."}, {"name": "Onward", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3f3bd7205e18b8af21c1e04ba5d8aafe.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 83, "tagname": "Charge", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10", "desc": "Edith controls Phylax to charge in the target direction, dealing 90<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+3% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies along the way.\n\nIf Phylax hits an enemy hero during the charge, it will stop immediately and throw them over its shoulder, dealing 108<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+5% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>."}, {"name": "Primal Wrath", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ef6910865a6be662572e4f8b43dc7a5a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 72, "tagname": "Morph", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 40", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: When inside Phylax, Edith accumulates Wrath based on damage taken (calculated before damage reduction).\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Edith ejects herself forward from Phylax, knocking back nearby enemies and taking flight for up to 8s. During this time, she gains new skills and can perform ranged Basic Attacks, each dealing 35<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+75% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+25% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. She also gains 350<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+5% Total HP)</span>-350<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+20% Total HP)</span> extra shield, 50% - 150% extra Attack Speed, and 5% - 20% Hybrid Lifesteal based on accumulated Wrath, and converts each point of <span style=\"color:#26e407\">Extra Physical Defense</span> and <span style=\"color:#26e407\">Extra Magic Defense</span> into 3.5 <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">Magic Power</span>."}, {"name": "Overload", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2fea4f679f7fd59d6ee9062960fe8cb8.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "After each skill cast, Edith and Phylax become Overloaded for 3s, during which all Basic Attacks will trigger chain lightning, dealing extra <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> equal to <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+20% Total Magic Power)</span> plus 3(+0.2*Hero Level)% of the target's Max HP to up to 4 enemies.\nChain lightning damage against Minions is increased to 150%."}, {"name": "Divine Retribution", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0afd44b80c98596aaf29cafb3b3a8a1f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5", "desc": "Edith exacts Divine Retribution on a target area, dealing 170<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+40% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies hit and slowing them by 30%. She then continues to deal 68<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+16% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in the area every 0.5s over the next 1.5s."}, {"name": "Lightning Bolt", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_bc15a9e8821ea55e507269a984459154.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10", "desc": "Edith fires a Lightning Bolt in a designated direction, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to the first enemy hero hit and immobilizing them for 0.8s."}, {"name": "Primal Wrath", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ef6910865a6be662572e4f8b43dc7a5a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 72, "tagname": "Morph", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 40", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: When inside Phylax, Edith accumulates Wrath based on damage taken (calculated before damage reduction).\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Edith ejects herself forward from Phylax, knocking back nearby enemies and taking flight for up to 8s. During this time, she gains new skills and can perform ranged Basic Attacks, each dealing 35<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+75% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+25% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. She also gains 350<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+5% Total HP)</span>-350<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+20% Total HP)</span> extra shield, 50% - 150% extra Attack Speed, and 5% - 20% Hybrid Lifesteal based on accumulated Wrath, and converts each point of <span style=\"color:#26e407\">Extra Physical Defense</span> and <span style=\"color:#26e407\">Extra Magic Defense</span> into 3.5 <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">Magic Power</span>."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Swift Boots - Dire Hit", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6c161eb8ae56cdfc87d6ee6fcdae05b3.png"}, {"name": "Thunder Belt", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_efae63dc9b3da2bb48dbea60de7c79bc.png"}, {"name": "Guardian Helmet", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_fc3154808d5848c4b3d28ea921ee58b9.png"}, {"name": "Antique Cuirass", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f20c5fef57268ccb59a1b818c0b0c769.png"}, {"name": "Oracle", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_bc24b55abbbec6da408eb0ea5c37cad4.png"}, {"name": "Immortality", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_cc8a7730e6d539ac10d2e0ed91bf2785.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Tank", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9854de7cfbb30c9fb0002521a274be4c.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Firmness", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6ef79730c08ec4e397d8241b3398fc4e.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Weapons Master", "icon": "https://akmweb.yo